  <h1>Privacy Policy for Daily Number Guess</h1>
  <p>
    At <strong>Daily Number Guess</strong>, we respect your privacy and keep data use minimal. This Privacy Policy explains what information is stored and how it is used.
  </p>

  <h2>Data Collection and Use</h2>
  <p>
    Daily Number Guess does not require account creation and does not collect personal data such as your name, email, or phone number.
    Gameplay state is stored locally in your browser to support core functionality.
  </p>

  <h2>What Is Stored Locally</h2>
  <p>The game may store limited local data, such as:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      A date value used to track whether you have already played on the current UK day.
    </li>
    <li>
      A same-day game snapshot (board/result state) so your completed or in-progress board can be restored after refresh.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cookies and Tracking</h2>
  <p>
    This site does not use cookies for gameplay.  
    It uses browser local storage only for game state and daily play tracking.
  </p>

  <h2>Data Sharing and Selling</h2>
  <p>
    We do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties.
    Local gameplay data remains on your device/browser.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>
    The game is hosted using third-party hosting infrastructure (for example, Vercel), which may process standard technical requests (such as IP address and request logs) required to serve web pages.
    We do not operate a custom backend database for storing your guesses or player profiles.
  </p>

  <h2>Your Control</h2>
  <p>
    You can remove stored game data at any time by clearing site data/local storage in your browser settings.
  </p>

  <h2>Updates</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect product or legal changes. Updates will be posted on this page with a revised date.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact Us</h2>
